            "review_text": "Ann N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam26 contributions\n0\nFood is ok, service is horrible, terrible, super duper bad!\nFeb 2015 • Business\nLast year my company held a new year party at this restaurant. The menu was quite diverse, quality was ok but the service, especially their employee's attitude was totally unacceptable! The waiters were very impolite, when I ask for wifi password, one waiter gave a can-not-be-any-shorter answer with a grumpy face. Even more, when I ask for the menu, he told me that it was outside and he was lazy?? I have no idea why this guy can even get a job? Anyway, stay away from this restaurant if you do care about service manner.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 11, 2016",
